{"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"halign"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:7IvorMXL18MXLLeftCenterRightO","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLLeftCenterRight","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"MXLLeftCenterRight"},{"kind":"text","text":"?"}],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"anchor":"discussion","type":"heading","text":"Discussion","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Words and music by Pat Songwriter"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Typically this type of credit is aligned to the right, so that the position information refers to the right-"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"most part of the text. But in this example, the text is center-justified, not right-justified."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The halign attribute is used in these situations. If it is not present, its value is the same as for the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"justify attribute. For elements where a justify attribute is not allowed, the default is implementation-"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"dependent."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Maps to the MusicXML "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"halign"},{"type":"text","text":" attribute."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLPercussion\/halign","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"kind":"symbol","variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlpercussion\/halign"]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLPercussion"]]},"sections":[],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"In cases where text extends over more than one line, horizontal alignment and justify values can be different."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The most typical case is for credits, such as:"}],"metadata":{"symbolKind":"property","externalID":"s:7IvorMXL13MXLPercussionV6halignAA18MXLLeftCenterRightOSgvp","modules":[{"name":"IvorMXL"}],"roleHeading":"Instance Property","role":"symbol","title":"halign","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"halign"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:7IvorMXL18MXLLeftCenterRightO","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"MXLLeftCenterRight"},{"kind":"text","text":"?"}]},"references":{"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL/MXLLeftCenterRight":{"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"enum"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"MXLLeftCenterRight"}],"title":"MXLLeftCenterRight","abstract":[{"text":"The left-center-right type is used to define horizontal alignment and text justification.","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLLeftCenterRight","role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlleftcenterright","kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MXLLeftCenterRight"}],"type":"topic"},"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL/MXLPercussion/halign":{"url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlpercussion\/halign","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLPercussion\/halign","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"In cases where text extends over more than one line, horizontal alignment and justify values can be different."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The most typical case is for credits, such as:"}],"title":"halign","fragments":[{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"halign","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:7IvorMXL18MXLLeftCenterRightO","text":